// MiMo-V2.6 (Xiaomi) - Flash-RL and Pro-RL share ONE preset.
// Sources: https://huggingface.co/XiaomiMiMo/MiMo-V2.6-Flash-RL
//          https://huggingface.co/XiaomiMiMo/MiMo-V2.6-Pro-RL
// Verified 2026-09-22 against both model cards, both chat templates and
// the vLLM MiMo-V2.5 recipe (the V2.6 cards point at it).
//
// ONE FILE FOR BOTH IS DELIBERATE. Pro-RL (1.02T/42B) and Flash-RL (309B/15B)
// differ only in backbone size. Everything this config expresses is identical:
// same family (mimo_v2), same chat template (byte-identical enable_thinking
// clause in both repos), 1,048,576-token native context on both, same serve
// flags (--reasoning-parser mimo --tool-call-parser mimo), same recommended
// sampling (temp=1.0, top_p=0.95 - also in generation_config.json). A second
// file would be a copy-paste twin waiting to drift. Do not split unless a
// future variant changes thinking semantics.
//
// MATCHING: two scoped patterns, one preset. findPresetForModel scans every
// pattern of every preset and the longest match wins, so a served id
// containing either string lands here. All 16 quantized Flash repos
// (ggml-org GGUF, mlx-community mxfp4, Vontra MLX-4bit, ProCreations NVFP4,
// ...) embed "MiMo-V2.6-Flash-RL" in their id, so they match too - quantization
// never changes the template. The patterns stay scoped to V2.6 on purpose:
// MiMo-V2-Flash and MiMo-V2.5 were NOT verified template-identical and must
// not be caught by a broad "MiMo" pattern.
//
// MOPD VARIANTS (verified 2026-11-06): MiMo-V2.6-Flash-MOPD and
// MiMo-V2.6-Pro-MOPD (2026-09-27, Xiaomi's tool-call-repetition fix stage)
// also land on this preset, deliberately. Primary sources agree with the RL
// checkpoints: the MOPD chat_template.jinja is the RL template minus one
// blank line (identical enable_thinking clause), the MOPD card names the same
// serve flags (--reasoning-parser mimo --tool-call-parser mimo) and the same
// sampling (temp=1.0, top_p=0.95, matching its generation_config.json), and
// both are 1M-context MiMoV2ForCausalLM.
//
// THINKING IS BINARY. The template only knows enable_thinking: true/false.
// With false it pre-fills an empty  block so the model skips reasoning;
// with true (or omitted) the model emits its own reasoning, extracted by the
// server's "mimo" reasoning parser. There is NO reasoning_effort and NO
// low/high/max ladder in this family - any such mode would be fiction.
//
// Modalities: both are omnimodal (text/image/video/audio). The extension
// schema only expresses imageInput; video/audio are not sent by Copilot.
//
// Token budgets (1,048,576 native context):
//   - Ladder tops at 131,072 (same reasoning as GLM-5.3-Flash): agentic RL
//     models burn long thinking traces; at full context that still leaves
//     ~917K input. On smaller serve windows pick a shorter Output Length.
//
// To apply manually, merge "config" into an existing model entry.
// Keep that entry's id, server and actual server model ID unchanged.

{
  "presetVersion": 1,
  "match": ["MiMo-V2.6-Flash", "MiMo-V2.6-Pro"],
  "meta": {
    "source": "https://huggingface.co/XiaomiMiMo/MiMo-V2.6-Flash-RL",
    "verified": "2026-11-06",
    "notes": "One preset for the V2.6 RL and MOPD checkpoints (identical template, parsers, sampling, 1M context). Binary thinking via enable_thinking - no effort levels. temp=1.0, top_p=0.95. Matches all quantized variants."
  },
  "config": {
    "displayName": "MiMo-V2.6",
    "family": "mimo_v2",
    "maxOutputTokens": [131072, 65536, 32768, 16384],
    "capabilities": {
      "toolCalling": true,
      "imageInput": true
    },
    "defaultParams": {
      "temperature": 1.0,
      "top_p": 0.95
    },
    "modelModes": {
      "high": {
        "chat_template_kwargs": {
          "enable_thinking": true
        }
      },
      "none": {
        "chat_template_kwargs": {
          "enable_thinking": false
        }
      }
    },
    "defaultMode": "high"
  }
}
